	Logon ID:		0x2B6B6C5
	Linked Logon ID:		0x0
	Network Account Name:	-
	Network Account Domain:	-
	Logon GUID:		{b11b2054-2976-9513-aba5-ec34450ba878}

Process Information:
	Process ID:		0x0
	Process Name:		-

Network Information:
	Workstation Name:	-
	Source Network Address:	::1
	Source Port:		54212

Detailed Authentication Information:
